# tools/keys/dequ-save-dc-setup.keys with its chargen removed: the DEX-13 orc warrior
# comes from tools/fixtures/chars/dequ-save-dc-seed5-opt0822.sav (INCURSION_LOAD),
# so no attribute set is picked by its shown values. What the setup did AFTER
# chargen is kept: wizard mode on, Cheat Death on (a long run of failed saves
# cannot end the session), Freeze Monsters on. bd inc-cr8v.

@until "Things in View" ESC

# 'w' opens wizard mode and 'y' confirms it the first time. The pair is driven
# by @until rather than written out, because a keystroke swallowed by a prompt
# that was still up would spend every key after it on the wrong thing.
@until "Wizard Mode Options" w y
@expect "Wizard Mode Switches"
w       # Open Wizard Mode Switches.
# The switch list draws no cursor a screen dump can see, so this counts rows:
# Freeze Monsters is the eleventh, and the cursor opens on the first.
@expect "Freeze Monsters"
SPACE   # Cheat Death: NO -> YES, so retaliation cannot end the run
DOWN*10
@expect "all monsters are denied their"
SPACE   # Freeze Monsters: NO -> YES
@expect "Wizard Mode Options"
ESC     # Close the switches list: a control key, not a named choice.
